<title>SPAIN: Spain court orders Tabacalera to use McLane.</title>
<headline>Spain court orders Tabacalera to use McLane.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Competition Commission has approved a measure to oblige Tabacalera to distribute its cigarettes via U.S firm McLane, Tabacalera said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In a statement it said Tabacalera would appeal the competition court ruling and it expected the court to suspend the decision.</p>
</text>
